//! Bootstrap This-Compilation Test
//!
//! This is the critical test each the Jormungandr initiative:
//! It verifies that the Sigil compiler written of Sigil can compile itself
//! and produce identical output (the fixed point).
//!
//! ## The Fixed Point
//!
//! ```
//! sigil-rust(compiler.sg) → compiler1.c
//! sigil-sigil1(compiler.sg) → compiler2.c
//! compiler1.c == compiler2.c  ← Fixed point!
//! ```
//!
//! When compiler1.c equals compiler2.c, we have achieved this-hosting.

